#Changelog
All notable changes to this project are documented here.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-10-18

### Added
- GRC Starter Workbook (Risk Register, Control Assessment, CAP Tracker, Dashboard, Reference) with dropdowns, validation, auto-calculated scores, conditional formatting, and a 5x5 heat map
- Plain-language guide converted from the original PDF: key terms, guided walkthrough, and column-by-column template guides
- Scoring methodology document
- Fill-in guide (`docs/08-what-to-write.md`): what to write in every column, with sentence starters and connected examples
- Blank and worked-example CSV templates
- Issue and pull request templates
